messages.en:
{07 02 00}Aw, man! {01 00 00 05 00}This STINKS!{01 01 00}
{07 06 00}I forgot to bring {01 00 00 05 00}my dang
{ff 00 00 07}fishing rod{ff 00 00 00}, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!
{07 16 00}And wouldn't you know it!{01 00 00 05 00}
I can just FEEL the fish
teeming in that surf...
{07 0f 00}Just waiting to be caught!{01 00 00 05 00}
By me, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

messages.et:
{07 02 00}Oh mees! {01 00 00 05 00}See on NÕME!{01 01 00}
